Per-theme license copies
------------------------
Each arch-boot-*/ directory repeats the licensing files above (LICENSE and
LICENSES/) so that a single theme can be copied or packaged on its own, as GPL
v2 section 1 requires ("give any other recipients of the Program a copy of
this License"). The copies are byte-identical to the repository-level files.
Keep all copies in sync if the licensing ever changes.

Plymouth is unaffected by these extra files: the script plugin reads only the
ImageDir and ScriptFile keys from the .plymouth descriptor and never enumerates
the theme directory.


